                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game feels like a flash game, in a good way! It's easy to pick up and fun to play. The game does lack depth, in a way that other flash games don't. It feels pretty rushed.\n\nFor example, melee weapons say they're purely cosmetic, but there are actual damage and range/hitbox differences. There are many unfinished features (this game came out in 2021 and shows no signs of updates).\n\nIt's fine. It's free, can't complain about a free experience that I actively enjoyed playing :)",
